==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension kvk sb 01|klukkustund}}
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[klukka]]'' meaning "[[clock]]" and ''[[stund]]'' meaning "[[hour]]". Literally meaning "hour of a clock" or "clock's hour".

===Noun===
'''klukkustund''' {{f}}
# [[hour]]

====Synonyms====
*[[klukkutími]]
*[[tími]] (''colloquial short form'')

